%% Diagrama de Sequência do Pipeline Diário — Newra News (PRD §3.2)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor VC as Vercel Cron
    participant NX as Next.js (API Route)
    participant API as Fastify API
    participant ND as NewsData.io
    participant RSS as RSS Feeds
    participant IA as Gemini / Groq
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    VC->>NX: GET /api/cron/daily-news (CRON_SECRET)
    NX->>API: POST /api/jobs/daily-pipeline (Bearer JOB_SECRET)
    API->>API: idempotência — já rodou hoje?<br/>(SUCCESS/RUNNING → retorna log existente)
    API-->>NX: { status: "started", pipelineId } (assíncrono)

    par Coleta paralela
        API->>ND: fetch 8 categorias (size=10, country=br, language=pt)
        API->>RSS: fetch 12 feeds
    end
    ND-->>API: RawNewsItem[]
    RSS-->>API: RawNewsItem[] (categoria por keyword classifier)
    API->>API: deduplicação por sourceUrl
    API->>DB: news.createMany()
    API->>IA: top 15 itens → prompt estruturado (truncado)
    IA-->>API: artigo em Markdown
    API->>DB: article.upsert (1 artigo por data)
    API->>DB: cleanup — news >30d, logs >30d, artigos >90d
    API->>DB: dailyMetric.upsert (newsByCategory, contagens, IA usada)
    API-->>NX: status final gravado no PipelineLog
